硬。花瓣与水面反射出微光，营造梦幻氛围。整体色调以淡紫、粉白、灰蓝为主，辅以金纹与银饰点缀，色彩和谐而富有层次。\\n\\n氛围静谧唯美，充满东方古典诗意，仿佛置身于春日清晨的古园秘境，女子如画中仙子，与自然融为一体，时光静止，唯花落无声。画面风格细腻写实，细节丰富，光影柔和，极具艺术感染力，适合用于古风插画、影视场景或高端艺术展示。\"]", [false, true]], "inputs": [{"name": "text", "link": 34, "label": "文本", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "PreviewTextNode", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [418.172119140625, 289.7995300292969], "pos": [458.33563232421875, 886.9443359375], "id": 25, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PreviewTextNode"}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "IMAGE", "links": [36], "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}], "color": "#322", "widgets_values": ["nearest-exact", 1342, 1780, "disabled"], "inputs": [{"name": "image", "link": 35, "label": "图像", "type": "IMAGE", "localized_name": "图像"}, {"widget": {"name": "upscale_method"}, "name": "upscale_method", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "缩放方法"}, {"widget": {"name": "width"}, "name": "width", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "宽度"}, {"widget": {"name": "height"}, "name": "height", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "高度"}, {"widget": {"name": "crop"}, "name": "crop", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "裁剪"}], "flags": {}, "type": "ImageScale", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#533", "size": [270, 130], "pos": [-400.3525085449219, 350.5810852050781], "id": 27, "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "ImageScale"}, "order": 11}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["反推之后，如果要替换人物，就点开LORA"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [140, 60], "pos": [1076.0113525390625, 9.347578048706055], "id": 34, "properties": {}, "order": 6}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "widgets_values": ["反推图片过小的话，可以调整尺寸。"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "Note", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#653", "size": [140, 60], "pos": [-571.3574829101562, 387.24237060546875], "id": 35, "properties": {}, "order": 7}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#432", "w